    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">părăgauda</span></b> , ae,
		and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">părăgau-dis</span></b> , is,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				border</i>, <i>lace</i>, worked on a garment.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auratae paragaudae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 11, 8, 2</span></i>
			; Cod. Th. 10, 21, 1.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a laced
			garment</i>: interulas paragaudas duas, Val. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Vop. Prob. 4</span></i>: paragaudem triuncem
			unam, id. ap. Treb. <i><span class="en">Claud. 17</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
